      </p>

      <!-- Table of Contents Card -->
      <div class="box" style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 24px; margin: 30px 0;">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 8px;">Table of Tribology &amp; Lubricant Science Topics</h3>
