          <li><a href="#base-oils-groups" target="_top" style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--primary);">2. Base Oils: Groups I-V Chemical Characterization</a></li>
          <li><a href="#polymer-vii" target="_top" style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--primary);">3. Viscosity Index Improvers &amp; Polymeric Expansion</a></li>
